I'm not going to spend too long on it.

1802
01:42:06,050 --> 01:42:10,010
But I need it to be a little, you know, presentable for my own sanity.

1803
01:42:10,830 --> 01:42:13,350
If I get another treehouse like that going, I...

1804
01:42:13,350 --> 01:42:14,210
