Oh, but I don't have bone meal.

1811
01:42:48,420 --> 01:42:49,080
So never mind.

1812
01:42:49,340 --> 01:42:50,240
It's like some advanced stuff.

1813
01:42:55,030 --> 01:42:55,430
Okay.

1814
01:42:55,990 --> 01:42:56,970
Now we make house.

1815
