Um, what's the word?

1832
01:44:42,820 --> 01:44:44,020
Variation is good, you know?

1833
01:44:56,050 --> 01:44:57,210
I don't even know how I'm doing...

1834
01:44:57,210 --> 01:44:57,430
What?

1835
01:45:05,620 --> 01:45:05,980
Okay.

1836
01:45:06,240 --> 01:45:08,380
This corner doesn't have a frickin' pillar.

1837
01:45:08,540 --> 01:45:09,600
