1838
01:45:11,940 --> 01:45:13,260
We don't need a pillar there.

1839
01:45:14,980 --> 01:45:15,740
It's fine.

1840
01:45:16,480 --> 01:45:17,840
Wait, this looks wrong as well.

1841
01:45:19,440 --> 01:45:20,640
There's something wrong about this.

1842
01:45:40,770 --> 01:45:41,530
Yeah, there we go.

1843
01:45:42,450 --> 01:45:43,570
Oh, wait, this is wrong.

1844
01:45:45,430 --> 01:45:46,470
Why is this so...

1845
