1847
01:45:52,570 --> 01:45:53,630
There we go, we did it.

1848
01:45:54,070 --> 01:45:54,310
Boom.

1849
01:45:55,670 --> 01:45:56,310
And now...

1850
01:45:56,310 --> 01:45:56,430
Whoop.

1851
01:45:57,090 --> 01:45:57,410
Have it.

1852
01:45:58,070 --> 01:45:58,690
Whoopsie-daisy.

1853
01:45:58,910 --> 01:45:59,390
There we go.

1854
01:45:59,570 --> 01:45:59,950
Missed it.

1855
01:46:00,430 --> 01:46:00,990
Precision gaming.

1856
01:46:01,190 --> 01:46:01,370
Whoop.

1857
01:46:02,010 --> 01:46:02,810
And now...

1858
01:46:02,810 --> 01:46:04,210
We make more wall.

1859
