We just need one more here.

1876
01:47:14,400 --> 01:47:15,840
And then we, um...

1877
01:47:15,840 --> 01:47:16,820
Ah, wait, wait, wait.

1878
01:47:19,760 --> 01:47:20,760
Yep, that's fine.

1879
01:47:22,540 --> 01:47:23,220
This is good.

1880
01:47:25,400 --> 01:47:26,840
