It's gonna look amazing.

1883
01:47:31,820 --> 01:47:34,860
It does not involve triangular patterns.

1884
01:47:35,860 --> 01:47:37,100
I'm totally over that.

1885
01:47:41,560 --> 01:47:43,540
Keep it simple, but nice.

1886
01:47:43,640 --> 01:47:43,980
You know what I mean?

1887
01:47:44,500 --> 01:47:44,700
Oops.

1888
01:47:45,900 --> 01:47:47,960
And we save a whole row of blocks as well.

1889
01:47:49,620 --> 01:47:50,560
Affordable housing.

1890
01:47:53,980 --> 01:47:54,500
Boom!

1891
01:47:55,260 --> 01:47:55,780
Lights!

1892
01:47:56,080 --> 01:47:56,820
Now it's a home.

1893
