1894
01:48:03,110 --> 01:48:03,590
Doctor.

1895
01:48:03,870 --> 01:48:04,350
Doctor.

1896
01:48:05,090 --> 01:48:05,570
Door.

1897
01:48:10,940 --> 01:48:12,000
That's actually kind of easy.

1898
01:48:21,240 --> 01:48:21,720
Nice!

1899
