Actually, we keep the floor as dirt.

1913
01:48:51,610 --> 01:48:52,530
Because it's like...

1914
01:48:52,530 --> 01:48:53,310
It's a design decision.

1915
01:48:54,690 --> 01:48:57,130
But we're gonna have it one layer lower, you know?

1916
01:48:57,210 --> 01:48:58,090
Just to make it look nice.

1917
01:49:03,130 --> 01:49:04,050
Contemporary style, right?

1918
