What are the...

1919
01:49:14,560 --> 01:49:14,960
Stairs.

1920
01:49:16,360 --> 01:49:17,280
That's what that's called.

1921
01:49:19,220 --> 01:49:19,620
Stairs.

1922
01:49:19,620 --> 01:49:19,760
Boink!

1923
01:49:21,560 --> 01:49:21,960
Nice!

1924
01:49:22,860 --> 01:49:23,880
