1927
01:49:26,740 --> 01:49:27,940
This is the standard practice.

1928
01:49:28,080 --> 01:49:29,340
We just put everything in first.

1929
01:49:29,840 --> 01:49:30,940
And then we take what we need.

1930
01:49:32,120 --> 01:49:32,820
