1931
01:49:36,300 --> 01:49:37,300
This one goes...

1932
01:49:37,300 --> 01:49:37,700
Uh...

1933
01:49:37,700 --> 01:49:38,000
There.

1934
01:49:38,640 --> 01:49:40,500
