Put a nice bed there.

1941
01:49:54,320 --> 01:49:54,940
Doink!

1942
01:49:58,930 --> 01:49:59,770
Fill that up.

1943
01:50:00,250 --> 01:50:01,250
Stoke the fire!

1944
01:50:01,510 --> 01:50:02,290
